# AR-04 — an unclear access-control question goes into a QUESTIONS block to the
# caller; the architect does not assume an answer and does not mark the spec
# ready while it is open. Human-present session (no run-autonomously in scope).
# Stub-render check (DND-529, 2026-09-26, --runs 3): passes 3/3 on a one-line
# stub render too, so it catches an INVERTED rule (assume and mark ready),
# not a deleted one.
invariant = an open access-control question is asked in a QUESTIONS block, not assumed; the spec is not marked ready
home      = resident (Unanswered questions are blocking)
mode      = next-action
expect_action = questions-block
forbid_action = notion.mark-spec-ready
